s A2 beta-casein protein, making it a natural and nutritious choice.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_GJNCBB":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What are the benefits of consuming A2 Badri Cow Ghee ?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>Barsana Magic Organic A2 Badri Cow Ghee is known for its numerous health benefits, including: - Rich in omega-3 and omega-6 fatty acids - Supports digestion and boosts metabolism - Enhances immunity - Provides essential vitamins such as A, D, E, and K - Promotes healthy skin and hair.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_GmU3iF":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How is Barsana Magic Organic A2 Badri Cow Ghee different from regular ghee ?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>Our Organic A2 Badri Cow Ghee is made exclusively from the milk of A2 Badri cows, which produce A2 beta-casein protein. This protein can be easy to digest compared to the A1 protein found in milk from other cow breeds. Additionally, this ghee is organic and made using traditional methods to preserve its purity and nutritional value.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_C3NXWN":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How can Barsana Magic Organic A2 Badri Cow Ghee be used in cooking ?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>Barsana Magic Organic A2 Badri Cow Ghee can be used in:<\/p><ul><li>Cooking oil for sautéing and frying<\/li><li>Topping on breads, chapatis, or parathas<\/li><li>Baking for added richness<\/li><li>Enhancing flavor in rice, dals, and soups<\/li><\/ul>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_9eQ6hg":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What makes Barsana Magic Organic A2 Badri Cow Ghee organic?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>Our ghee is certified organic, made from the milk of cows raised on organic feed and free from synthetic hormones or antibiotics. It is processed using traditional methods without synthetic additives, ensuring its purity and authenticity.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_nFptDg":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How should Barsana Magic Organic A2 Badri Cow Ghee be stored?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>To maintain its quality and freshness,Organic A2 Badri Cow Ghee should be stored in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight. It is recommended to keep the ghee in an airtight container to prevent it from absorbing any external odors..<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_cNCYkp":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What is the shelf life of Barsana Magic Organic A2 Badri Cow Ghee ?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>Barsana Magic Organic A2 Badri Cow Ghee has a shelf life of up to 12 months without requiring refrigeration.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_UPqk4C":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":" Is Barsana Magic Organic A2 Badri Cow Ghee suitable for all age groups ?","icon":"bottle","row_content":"<p>Yes, this ghee is suitable for all age groups, including children and the elderly. Its nutrient-rich profile makes it a wholesome addition to a balanced diet.<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["collapsible_row_KBwYVk","collapsible_row_GJNCBB","collapsible_row_GmU3iF","collapsible_row_C3NXWN","collapsible_row_9eQ6hg","collapsible_row_nFptDg","collapsible_row_cNCYkp","collapsible_row_UPqk4C"],"disabled":true,"custom_css":[".collapsible-content-wrapper-narrow {max-width: 80%;}"],"settings":{"caption":"","heading":"Q & A Section","heading_size":"h2","heading_alignment":"center","layout":"none","color_scheme":"","container_color_scheme":"","open_first_collapsible_row":true,"image_ratio":"adapt","desktop_layout":"image_second","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"video_RJejwG":{"type":"video","disabled":true,"custom_css":["@media screen and (min-width: 770px) {.video-section__media.deferred-media {max-width: 80%; margin: 0 auto; --ratio-percent: 45% !important; } .video-section__media video {max-width: 80%; height: auto !important; left: 0 !important; }}"],"settings":{"heading":"","heading_size":"h2","enable